-labs-jules[bot]", "email": "161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2025-09-12T17:08:54Z"}, "message": "This commit includes the complete implementation of the Library Service microservice as per the specifications for tasks 1-23.\n\nKey features implemented:\n- Core application logic using NestJS, TypeORM with PostgreSQL, and Redis for caching.\n- API endpoints for managing user libraries and purchase history, with Swagger documentation.\n- Business logic for adding/removing games, checking ownership, and searching.\n- Security layer with placeholder Guards for JWT, ownership, and roles.\n- HTTP clients for integration with GameCatalog and User services.\n- Comprehensive test suite including unit, integration, and E2E tests.\n- Docker and Kubernetes files for containerization and deployment.\n- Placeholder setup for future Kafka integration and Prometheus monitoring.\n- All code is structured according to the project's conventions and specifications.", "tree": {"sha": "481ffaaf3efcd25a5e015a8fe78450e916d4b47b", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/wizarding-anonymous/cryo/git/trees/481ffaaf3efcd25a5e015a8fe78450e916d4b47b"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/wizarding-anonymous/cryo/git/commits/c3d92c89bf37a19d64a54beda5cb2a06175f61c8", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/wizarding-anonymous/cryo/commits/c3d92c89bf37a19d64a54beda5cb2a06175f61c8", "html_url": "https://github.com/wizarding-anonymous/cryo/commit/c3d92c89bf37a19d64a54beda5cb2a06175f61c8", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/wizarding-anonymous/cryo/commits/c3d92c89bf37a19d64a54beda5cb2a06175f61c8/comments", "author": {"login": "google-labs-jules[bot]", "id": 161369871, "node_id": "BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/goog